@startuml activity-record-payment
title Activity: record, confirm, decline or cancel a payment\nFR-004, FR-016, FR-021, FR-022, FR-031, FR-034 to FR-038, FR-049; NFR-001, NFR-002, NFR-005, NFR-006, NFR-010, NFR-011\nScenarios US6-AS1 to US6-AS9, US2-AS9
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Paying member|
start
:Open the payment form in group G
and choose the receiving member;
|PaymentService|
:allowance(session, G, receiver) on a worker:
debt = max(0.00, live pair debt in G from APPROVED shares
and CONFIRMED payments), reserved = sum of AWAITING
payments payer to receiver in G, available =
max(0.00, debt - reserved) (FR-037, D-3);
|Paying member|
:See confirmed debt, reserved and available
shown separately (US6-AS7);
:Enter amount as decimal text, date, optional note;
|PaymentService|
:CommandRunner: lock group G, open one UnitOfWork,
replay check on the operation ID (NFR-010);
if (Payer = session member, payer and receiver both\nactive members of G and distinct? (FR-035, FR-004)) then (no)
  |Paying member|
  :Refused: a payment cannot be recorded
  for another payer or a nonmember (US6-AS9);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|PaymentService|
if (Amount 0.01 to 100,000.00 with two decimals\nand date present? (FR-016, FR-037)) then (no)
  |Paying member|
  :Field message naming the problem,
  other entries kept (US6-AS3, NFR-005);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|PaymentService|
:Recompute available inside the lock;
if (Amount <= available in this group\nand direction?) then (no)
  |Paying member|
  :Refused, showing debt, reserved and available.
  Other groups and the opposite direction never
  add allowance (US6-AS3, US6-AS7, US6-AS9);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|PaymentService|
:Insert Payment AWAITING_CONFIRMATION (recorder,
recorded time), PAYMENT_RECORDED notification to the
receiver and the operation result; commit together
(FR-036, FR-021, US6-AS4);
note right
  The reservation is the AWAITING row itself:
  no reservation table and no balance change.
  Commit failure: NOT_COMMITTED, input kept.
  Uncertain commit: UNKNOWN, look up the
  operation ID before any retry (US1-AS9).
end note
|Receiving member|
:Open the payment from the inbox or
payment history (FR-023, FR-038);
:Choose Confirm or Decline;
|PaymentService|
:CommandRunner: lock group G (the same group lock used by
expense approval and departures), open one UnitOfWork;
if (Actor is the receiver and an active member?) then (no)
  |Receiving member|
  :Refused, nothing changes (FR-036, US6-AS9);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|PaymentService|
if (Status is AWAITING_CONFIRMATION?) then (no: terminal)
  |Receiving member|
  :Refused: CONFIRMED, DECLINED and CANCELLED
  are terminal, a payment is never applied twice
  (FR-036, US6-AS9);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|PaymentService|
if (Decision?) then (confirm)
  :Re-read the live debt payer to receiver in G,
  without subtracting this payment's own reservation
  (FR-037, D-3);
  if (Amount <= live debt?) then (no)
    |Receiving member|
    :Refused with the current debt. Status stays
    AWAITING_CONFIRMATION, balances unchanged.
    The receiver may decline it instead. Covers debt
    shrinking, reaching zero or reversing (US6-AS8);
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  |PaymentService|
  :Set CONFIRMED with decision actor and Clock time,
  release its reservation, save the operation result,
  commit (FR-036, US6-AS1, US6-AS2);
  |Paying member|
  :Derived balance falls by the amount; shown as
  settled at 0.00 (FR-031, FR-034, SC-006);
  stop
else (decline)
  |PaymentService|
  :Set DECLINED with decision actor, time and optional
  reason; reservation released; save the operation
  result and commit (FR-036, US6-AS5);
  |Paying member|
  :Balance unchanged; DECLINED shown in
  payment history (FR-038);
  stop
endif

|PaymentService|
start
:Third terminal path, started by a permitted departure of the
payer or the receiver from G (activity-remove-member, FR-049);
:In the departure transaction, each AWAITING payment between them
becomes CANCELLED with a separate lifecycle event (actor, reason,
time). Its reservation is released, no balance changes, and the remaining
party is notified unless they initiated it (FR-021, US2-AS9);
|Paying member|
:History shows CANCELLED with the lifecycle reason,
never as the receiver's decision (FR-038, US6-AS6);
stop
@enduml
